# Static Linux — no graphical environment ("tty" and "servidor" on the
# installer's environment page). Installed instead of a desktop list.
# The graphical packages base.list would bring are left out by basepkgs:
# see sin-escritorio-omitir.list.

tmux
btop
# console font with full Latin/Cyrillic/Greek coverage, readable on HiDPI
terminus-font
# mouse copy/paste in the Linux console
gpm
